WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.361 --> 00:00:17.063
Jason saw Chef standing near the recipe screen.

2
00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:22.145
"We're having a baking contest today," Chef said.

3
00:00:23.145 --> 00:00:24.386
Jason's eyes lit up.

4
00:00:24.406 --> 00:00:26.567
"That sounds fun!"

5
00:00:26.587 --> 00:00:28.727
"What are we baking?"

6
00:00:28.747 --> 00:00:29.848
Izzie asked.

7
00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:33.180
Chef pointed to the screen.

8
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:37.362
"A simple brownie recipe with only four ingredients."

9
00:00:37.382 --> 00:00:41.003
"I love chocolate!"

10
00:00:41.443 --> 00:00:42.103
Nina said.

11
00:00:43.103 --> 00:00:43.943
Bobby grinned.

12
00:00:43.963 --> 00:00:46.944
"I'm going to win this contest!"

13
00:00:48.885 --> 00:00:49.885
Jason frowned.

14
00:00:50.945 --> 00:00:53.026
Bobby always wanted to win everything.

15
00:00:53.046 --> 00:00:57.827
"Izzie and Bobby—you'll be Team 1," Chef said.

16
00:00:57.847 --> 00:01:02.024
"Jason and Nina will be Team 2.

17
00:01:02.064 --> 00:01:02.825
I'll be the judge."

18
00:01:04.086 --> 00:01:05.968
"Our brownies will taste better!"

19
00:01:05.988 --> 00:01:06.949
Izzie said.

20
00:01:07.850 --> 00:01:09.451
Bobby gave her a high-five.

21
00:01:11.293 --> 00:01:12.454
Jason kept quiet.

22
00:01:13.475 --> 00:01:15.676
He loved cooking, and he wanted to do well.

23
00:01:18.579 --> 00:01:20.521
Chef had two cooking stations ready.

24
00:01:21.602 --> 00:01:22.903
The kids took their places.

25
00:01:24.905 --> 00:01:26.987
Chef preheated the oven to 180 degrees Celsius.

26
00:01:30.016 --> 00:01:34.098
Jason looked at the bananas, peanut butter, cocoa powder, and chocolate chips.

27
00:01:34.118 --> 00:01:38.740
"Amazing! We only need four ingredients to make brownies."

28
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:40.780
Nina nodded.

29
00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:45.542
"First, we mash three bananas in a bowl."

30
00:01:46.743 --> 00:01:49.304
She and Jason took turns mashing them with a fork.

31
00:01:51.165 --> 00:01:53.205
Team 1 did the same thing.

32
00:01:53.225 --> 00:01:55.766
"We're Number 1!

33
00:01:56.247 --> 00:01:57.607
We're Number 1!"

34
00:01:58.007 --> 00:01:58.868
Bobby chanted.

35
00:01:59.904 --> 00:02:01.645
"Don't worry, Team 2!"

36
00:02:03.706 --> 00:02:04.466
Izzie laughed.

37
00:02:04.486 --> 00:02:08.468
"We'll share our winning brownies with you."

38
00:02:08.488 --> 00:02:11.009
"Team 1!"

39
00:02:11.569 --> 00:02:12.409
Chef frowned.

40
00:02:12.429 --> 00:02:15.710
"Mix your brownies and leave Team 2 alone."

41
00:02:15.730 --> 00:02:20.052
"Sorry, Chef," Bobby said.

42
00:02:23.834 --> 00:02:26.715
Izzie scooped peanut butter into a measuring cup.

43
00:02:27.435 --> 00:02:29.196
Then she tried to dump it into the bowl.

44
00:02:30.744 --> 00:02:32.525
But the peanut butter stuck to the cup.

45
00:02:34.447 --> 00:02:35.727
"Ugh!" she said.

46
00:02:35.748 --> 00:02:40.991
"Izzie didn't use cooking spray," Jason whispered.

47
00:02:41.011 --> 00:02:44.353
"Remember when we made peanut butter dog treats?

48
00:02:45.254 --> 00:02:46.275
We learned that tip!"

49
00:02:48.216 --> 00:02:49.897
"Right!" Nina said.

50
00:02:52.819 --> 00:02:55.601
She got the cooking spray and sprayed the measuring cup.

51
00:02:57.302 --> 00:02:59.684
Jason measured one-half cup of peanut butter.

52
00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:03.982
When he dumped it into the bowl, it slid right out.

53
00:03:04.002 --> 00:03:06.825
"Good job!"

54
00:03:07.185 --> 00:03:07.865
Nina said.

55
00:03:09.547 --> 00:03:10.448
Jason bowed.

56
00:03:10.468 --> 00:03:12.049
"Thank you."

57
00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:15.732
Nina added cocoa powder next.

58
00:03:18.634 --> 00:03:22.117
At Station 1, Bobby dumped in the cocoa powder too fast.

59
00:03:23.058 --> 00:03:24.719
A cloud rose up from the bowl.

60
00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:26.941
Izzie had some on her chin.

61
00:03:26.961 --> 00:03:30.244
"Watch it, Bobby!"

62
00:03:30.724 --> 00:03:31.245
she said.

63
00:03:31.265 --> 00:03:35.748
"Now we mix everything together," Jason said.

64
00:03:38.810 --> 00:03:40.751
He saw Chef watching them closely.

65
00:03:44.234 --> 00:03:47.896
Nina started the mixer and blended the ingredients into a thick batter.

66
00:03:49.738 --> 00:03:52.760
Jason folded a half cup of chocolate chips into the batter.

67
00:03:54.861 --> 00:03:56.102
Bobby started shouting.

68
00:03:56.122 --> 00:03:58.224
"I can do it!"

69
00:04:00.236 --> 00:04:02.157
"You're making a mess!"

70
00:04:03.717 --> 00:04:05.658
Izzie pulled the mixer away from Bobby.

71
00:04:07.798 --> 00:04:09.839
Jason was glad Nina was his partner.

72
00:04:11.459 --> 00:04:13.300
Nina greased the baking pan.

73
00:04:14.280 --> 00:04:15.480
Jason poured the batter.

74
00:04:17.661 --> 00:04:19.321
Chef put the two pans in the oven.

75
00:04:19.341 --> 00:04:22.942
"Team 1's brownies are on the left.

76
00:04:24.002 --> 00:04:25.463
Team 2's on the right."

77
00:04:27.423 --> 00:04:29.284
The kids were quiet as they cleaned up.

78
00:04:31.084 --> 00:04:33.866
When the timer beeped, Chef took the pans out.

79
00:04:38.448 --> 00:04:39.909
Jason's shoulders slumped.

80
00:04:39.929 --> 00:04:42.891
"They look exactly the same.

81
00:04:44.171 --> 00:04:45.432
How will you pick a winner?"

82
00:04:47.493 --> 00:04:48.334
Chef smiled.

83
00:04:48.354 --> 00:04:51.075
"They probably taste the same too.

84
00:04:52.136 --> 00:04:55.517
But that's okay because I declare Team 2 the winner.

85
00:04:57.338 --> 00:04:59.940
Nina and Jason, you worked very well together."

86
00:05:01.568 --> 00:05:03.349
Jason and Nina grinned at each other.

87
00:05:03.369 --> 00:05:11.454
"Yes!" When the brownies were cool, Chef cut them into squares.

88
00:05:13.775 --> 00:05:14.795
Everybody took one.

89
00:05:14.815 --> 00:05:18.537
"Congratulations, Team 2!"

90
00:05:20.458 --> 00:05:22.139
Bobby high-fived Jason.

91
00:05:22.159 --> 00:05:25.861
"Great teamwork," Izzie said.

92
00:05:25.881 --> 00:05:29.083
"Great brownies too!"

93
00:05:29.523 --> 00:05:30.344
Jason said.
